#. module: simplify_access_management
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:simplify_access_management.access_management_form_view_ah
msgid ""
"You can Hide reports, Hide action buttons like Create, Edit, Export, Hide Views (list, kanban, report, etc), Also hide some actions like Archive, Delete, Duplicate, etc from defined user(s).\n"
"                                    <br/><br/>Note: the restriction added here will only become hidden for defined users. They can still be accessed by python code or API, so it won't intruppet the process in some cases like from POS and API. If you strictly want to block the Create, Edit, Delete process entirely from the user, you can use the 'Domain Access' Tab of the form and deine the rule there.\n"
"                                    <br/><br/>  More Info :"
msgstr ""

#. module: simplify_access_management
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:simplify_access_management.access_management_form_view_ah
